#. help text - part 1/3
#: src/clients/inst_hwinfo.rb:188
msgid ""
"<P><B>Detected Hardware</B><BR>This table contains all hardware components "
"detected in your system.</P>"
msgstr ""
"<P><B>ຮາດແວທີ່ກວດພົບ</B><BR>ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບຮາດແວທີ່ກວດພົບໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ.</"
"P>"

#. help text - part 2/3
#: src/clients/inst_hwinfo.rb:192
msgid ""
"<P><B>Details</B><BR>Select a component and press <B>Details</B> to see a "
"more detailed description of the component.</P>"
msgstr ""
"<P><B>ລາຍລະອຽດ</B><BR>ເລືອກສ່ວນປະກອບແລ້ວກົດ <B>ລາຍລະອຽດ</B> ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຄຳອະທິບາຍທີ່ລະອຽດຂຶ້"
"ນຂອງສ່ວນປະກອບນັ້ນ.</P>"

#. help text - part 3/3
#: src/clients/inst_hwinfo.rb:196
msgid ""
"<P><B>Save to File</B><BR>You can save\n"
"    hardware information (<I>hwinfo</I> output) to a file.</P>"
msgstr ""
"<P><B>ບັນທຶກລົງໄຟລ໌</B><BR>ທ່ານສາມາດບັນທຶກ\n"
"    ຂໍ້ມູນຮາດແວ (<I>hwinfo</I> output) ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ໄດ້.</P>"

